flowchart LR
  subgraph TRAIN[Training and model creation]
    D[Public Bitext tickets] --> C[Clean text and remove duplicates]
    C --> S[Grouped train/dev/calibration/test split]
    S --> E[MiniLM sentence embeddings]
    E --> H[HDBSCAN intent discovery]
    H --> R[Review clusters and merge overlaps]
    R --> CAT[Frozen bitext-v2 catalog]
    CAT --> L[Local-first labels]
    L --> T[Teacher review for uncertain cases]
    T --> Y[Resolved training labels]
    Y --> M[TF-IDF features]
    M --> LR[Logistic regression]
    M --> SVM[Linear SVM]
    LR --> V[Development evaluation and calibration]
    SVM --> V
    V --> B[Packaged classifier-v2 bundle]
  end

  subgraph PRED[Prediction and handoff]
    X[New support ticket] --> P[Shared preprocessing]
    P --> Q[Classifier inference]
    Q --> G{Confidence and margin policy}
    G -->|accepted| I[Intent, domain, confidence]
    G -->|unclear| U[unknown.require_more_info]
    I --> A[Deep-agent handoff]
  end

  B -. reload at runtime .-> Q
